2)  IMPORTED SLOTTED RUBBER CLOSURES
2.1  Charge batch quantity of slotted rubber closures in to the Bubbler.      
2.2  Rinse with sufficent quantity of filtered distilled water using    
     counter flow technique. 
      Date:________.  Qty. of plugs________
      Rinsing done by.________.      Rinsing clarity checked by.________.
2.3  Divide the rinsed closures in to small S.S.Containers.Rinse the plugs 
     with D.W.  once or twice.
2.4  Transfer plugs of above containers in to another container having 100 ml 
     of filtered D.W.and supporting s.s.mesh. Prepare such containers for the 
     required batch quantity.Qty of D.W.in container checked by:______.
2.5  Autoclave at 15 psi (121øC) for 75 minutes. 
